OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrests at rival protests in
OL,4,APortsmouth
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 33-year-old Portsmouth man was
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of obstructing a
OL,8,Fhighway and 16-year-old boy was
OL,9,Farrested on suspicion of violent
OL,10,Fdisorder linked to a similar protest at
OL,11,FEastney Marina on Sunday.
